    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roulette Pro Simulator</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590020/extras/327cd7957f9daabd97775da71967ab8f.avif?t=1754314445\" width=600 height=190 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roulette Pro Simulator drops you into the thrill of the spin\u2014heart racing, palms sweating, and pure excitement as the ball bounces toward your fate. Will luck be on your side, or will you be shaking your fist at the wheel? There's only one way to find out!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590020/extras/606c59077ebc18b7280195730bacda9c.poster.avif?t=1754314445\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590020/extras/606c59077ebc18b7280195730bacda9c.webm?t=1754314445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590020/extras/606c59077ebc18b7280195730bacda9c.mp4?t=1754314445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Roulette Pro Simulator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roulette Pro Simulator brings the rush of the casino straight to you. With every spin, anticipation builds as the ball dances around the wheel, teasing the possibility of a big win\u2014or a dramatic loss. It\u2019s a game of luck, strategy, and pure adrenaline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590020/extras/5f006a11e258bab979eba2fd323095df.poster.avif?t=1754314445\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590020/extras/5f006a11e258bab979eba2fd323095df.webm?t=1754314445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590020/extras/5f006a11e258bab979eba2fd323095df.mp4?t=1754314445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a cautious bettor or an all-in risk-taker, every round is a new chance to beat the odds. Feel the highs of a winning streak and the heartbreak of near misses in a game where fortune changes in a heartbeat. Place your bets and let the wheel decide!</p>",
